<title>USA: CBOE to trade Ortel options from June 17.</title>
<headline>CBOE to trade Ortel options from June 17.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Wednesday it will begin trading options on Ortel Corp shares on June 17.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will open with strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20 and initial expirations in July, August, November and February.</p>
<p>The options will trade in the Wal-Mart Stores Inc trading crowd, it said.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
